  "query_preview": "..\n(Sunday through next Friday)\nIssued at 1039 PM CDT Thu Oct 15 2026\n\nThe colder airmass will have some spots on the Cumberland Plateau \nlooking at their first frost of the season Sunday morning. After the \ncold front passes, high pressure will settle in for the work week, \nunfortunately warming our temperatures back into the upper 70s by \nmid week. Fortunately, we look to stay around seasonal normals for \ntemperatures, and not get as anomalously warm as we were this week. \nThe forecast has no precipitation after Sunday, so this is bad news \nfor the ongoing drought in Middle Tennessee.",
